# render_game.sym  Phase 5 delta for the game-side draw layer (docs/ANALYSIS/22_rendering.md sections 1, 2, 6);
# SLUS_216.21 SHA-256 d1b163eb...3957bc. Written 2026-10-20 from the recompiled bodies (recomp/generated, emitted from the ELF) and the
# ELF's strings; the IDA master was not opened. Rows: <addr8> <size8> <F|D> <name> <tags>
#   source=phase5-render_game verified=yes   our own name (no hint was used)
#   ev=game/src/render/draw_layer.cpp        the hand-decompiled body (pair-tested against the recompiled one in
#                                            tests/game/test_render_game.cpp)
# Not imported by the agent: the lead merges this with tools/ours/ida/import_symbols.py and re-exports symbols/. game/ keeps the sub_*
# names until then (game/README.md rule). Already proposed in rendering.sym and not repeated: the 3D-on-2D / etc / K_SPipe passes and
# btlUpdateDraw3DTask. No name is proposed for sub_126710, sub_269F50 and sub_422670 (the callers that would say what they draw were
# not read).
